Basics
One-line comment: <!- txt -->
Multi-line comments: html above/below
Headers: # H1, ## H2, ### H3
Bold: **Bold** or __Bold__
Italics: *Italics* or _Italics_
Strikethrough: ~~Strike~~
Blockquote: > Quote
Horizontal Rule: --- 

Lists & Links
Unordered List: - Item or * Item
Ordered List: 1. Item
Links: [Link Name](https://example.com)
Image: ![Alt Text](image_url.jpg) 

Code & Tables
Inline Code: `code`
Code Block: ``` code ```
Table: |  | | headings ----
         
Special
Task List: - [ ] To-do and - [x] Done
Escape Character: \* (displays * instead of italics)
